## 📋 **Site Management**

### **List All Sites**
```bash
# List all websites
easyinstall list

# Output example:
📋 Traditional Websites (port 80) with Redis:
  • http://site1.com (Redis port: 6379)
  • http://site2.com (Redis port: 6380)

🐳 Docker Sites:
  • dockersite.com - http://192.168.1.100:8080
```

### **Delete a Site**
```bash
# Delete traditional site (removes files, DB, Redis)
easyinstall delete example.com

# Delete Docker site
easyinstall delete docker-site.com

# Force delete (skip confirmation)
yes | easyinstall delete example.com
```

### **Site Information**
```bash
# View site credentials
cat /root/example.com-credentials.txt

# View site files
ls -la /var/www/html/example.com

# View Docker site files
ls -la /var/lib/docker-sites/wordpress/example.com

# Check site logs
tail -f /var/log/nginx/example.com.error.log
tail -f /var/log/nginx/example.com.access.log
```

