## 💾 **Backup Commands**

### **Local Backups**
```bash
# Create daily backup
easyinstall backup
easyinstall backup daily

# Create weekly backup
easyinstall backup weekly

# Create monthly backup
easyinstall backup monthly

# Backup specific Docker site
easyinstall backup-docker example.com

# Backup with custom name
easyinstall backup --name=pre-update
```

### **Backup Locations**
```bash
# Daily backups
ls -la /backups/daily/

# Weekly backups
ls -la /backups/weekly/

# Monthly backups
ls -la /backups/monthly/

# Docker site backups
ls -la /backups/docker/example.com/
```

### **Backup Management**
```bash
# View last backup
ls -lt /backups/daily/ | head -5

# Check backup size
du -sh /backups/daily/*

# Extract and inspect backup
cd /tmp
tar -xzf /backups/daily/backup-20240101-020001.tar.gz
ls -la
```

