## ✨ **Advanced Features**

### **Git Integration**
```bash
# Initialize git for a site
easyinstall git init example.com https://github.com/user/repo.git

# Deploy site from git
easyinstall git deploy example.com

# Check git status
easyinstall git status example.com

# Pull latest changes
easyinstall git pull example.com

# Push changes to remote
easyinstall git push example.com

# View git log
easyinstall git log example.com

# Create bare repository
easyinstall git create-repo myproject
```

### **Git Advanced Commands**
```bash
# Clone specific branch
easyinstall git init example.com https://github.com/user/repo.git --branch=develop

# Deploy with submodules
easyinstall git deploy example.com --recursive

# Setup webhook for auto-deploy
easyinstall git webhook example.com
```

### **Staging Sites**
```bash
# Create staging site
easyinstall staging create example.com
# Staging URL: http://staging.example.com

# Sync staging to production
easyinstall staging sync example.com

# Delete staging site
easyinstall staging delete example.com

# List all staging sites
easyinstall staging list

# Push staging to production
easyinstall staging push example.com

# Compare staging with production
easyinstall staging diff example.com
```

### **Staging Advanced**
```bash
# Create staging with specific DB
easyinstall staging create example.com --db-copy

# Sync specific tables only
easyinstall staging sync example.com --tables=wp_posts,wp_options

# Create staging from backup
easyinstall staging create example.com --from-backup=20240101
```

### **Cloud Backup**
```bash
# Configure Google Drive
easyinstall cloud-backup configure-gdrive

# Configure AWS S3
easyinstall cloud-backup configure-s3

# Backup site to Google Drive
easyinstall cloud-backup backup example.com gdrive

# Backup site to AWS S3
easyinstall cloud-backup backup example.com s3

# Backup to both
easyinstall cloud-backup backup example.com both

# List cloud backups
easyinstall cloud-backup list example.com
easyinstall cloud-backup list example.com gdrive
easyinstall cloud-backup list example.com s3

# Schedule cloud backups
easyinstall cloud-backup schedule daily gdrive
easyinstall cloud-backup schedule weekly s3
```

### **Cloud Backup Options**
```bash
# Backup with encryption
easyinstall cloud-backup backup example.com gdrive --encrypt

# Backup with compression level
easyinstall cloud-backup backup example.com s3 --compress=9

# Incremental backup
easyinstall cloud-backup backup example.com gdrive --incremental

# Verify backup after upload
easyinstall cloud-backup backup example.com s3 --verify
```

### **One-Click Restore**
```bash
# Restore latest local backup
easyinstall restore example.com latest local

# Restore specific backup
easyinstall restore example.com backup-20240101.tar.gz local

# Restore from Google Drive
easyinstall restore example.com latest gdrive

# Restore from AWS S3
easyinstall restore example.com latest s3

# Restore with options
easyinstall restore example.com latest local --db-only
easyinstall restore example.com latest local --files-only
```

### **Restore Management**
```bash
# Preview restore (dry run)
easyinstall restore example.com latest local --dry-run

# Force restore (skip confirmation)
easyinstall restore example.com latest local --force

# Restore and verify
easyinstall restore example.com latest local --verify

# Rollback if needed
easyinstall restore example.com --rollback
```

