## 🔧 **System Commands**

### **Service Management**
```bash
# Restart all services
systemctl restart nginx php8.2-fpm mysql redis-server

# Stop all services
systemctl stop nginx php8.2-fpm mysql redis-server

# Start all services
systemctl start nginx php8.2-fpm mysql redis-server

# Check all services
easyinstall status
```

### **Firewall Commands**
```bash
# Check firewall status
ufw status verbose

# Allow custom port
ufw allow 8080/tcp

# Deny IP
ufw deny from 192.168.1.100

# Delete rule
ufw delete allow 8080/tcp
```

### **Fail2ban Commands**
```bash
# Check banned IPs
fail2ban-client status
fail2ban-client status sshd
fail2ban-client status wordpress

# Unban IP
fail2ban-client set sshd unbanip 192.168.1.100

# Check fail2ban logs
tail -f /var/log/fail2ban.log
```

