## 🛠️ **Maintenance Commands**

### **System Updates**
```bash
# Update all packages
apt update && apt upgrade -y

# Update EasyInstall
cd /path/to/easyinstall
git pull
sudo ./easyinstall.sh --update

# Check for updates
easyinstall --version
easyinstall check-updates
```

### **Cleanup Commands**
```bash
# Clean Docker system
docker system prune -f
docker system prune -a --volumes

# Clean old logs
find /var/log -name "*.log" -size +100M -exec truncate -s 0 {} \;

# Clean package cache
apt clean
apt autoremove -y

# Clean old backups
find /backups/daily -type f -mtime +7 -delete
```

### **Performance Tuning**
```bash
# Check system load
uptime
top

# Check memory usage
free -m

# Check disk I/O
iostat -x 1

# Check network
iftop
nethogs
```

